# Testing

Before finishing significant work:

```bash
npm test
npm run lint
npm run build
```

- Add focused tests next to changed domain/service/UI behavior.
- Never delete/skip/weaken tests to get green.
- Prefer Vitest + Testing Library patterns already in the repo.
- For offline/sync/backup/security/PDF: cover readable legacy data, missing fields, invalid input, offline mode.
- Do not mark manual device QA complete without evidence.
